{"id":"vod_md_3061","vodId":"3061","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"来自新世界","name_cn":"来自新世界","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"25集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230823-1/c1f7958bbd7610d1c5e09c2bea0ff570.jpg"},"summary":"《来自新世界》改编自贵志祐介所著的科幻类小说作品。1000年后的日本，孩子们不断地消失，只存在想象中的恐怖动物与人类展开殊死战争。反乌托邦式的未来超级社会“新世界”，是口吐真言凭藉“咒力”就能移动物体的人类，与有著等同于普通人智力的生物“妖鼠”共存的世界。乍看之下一切和平，但“新世界”的孩子们的行动被彻底地控制和管束著，不合适的记忆被消去，被认为有问题的孩子，如同不良产品般被分开处理。得到被称为“咒力”的特殊能力的人们在“八丁标”的结界中促成一个小小的团体，无论是思想还是对外界的认知，记忆、爱、甚至生命的支配都被统治着。在这其中，渡辺早季、朝比奈覚、秋月真理亜、伊东守、青沼瞬五位少年和少女们，为了守护日益衰弱的世界和同伴，投身到了各种各样的冒险的旅程中......","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-23 08:48:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"classicRank":111,"franchise":"来自新世界","playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/IzsS0exv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/hHy130Xw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/BUqBtASy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/Ve3gDzYb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/I7Omylgc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/jHrHCtRx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/1pe9Vm5P/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/VwWCMThE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/XrRD5CdX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/DTDcFt4k/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/7756UlQ4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/rIYJSiUW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/QHsTMGIX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230821/wSuAzFI0/index.m3u8"}